t%20original%20constructor%20order%20for%20the%20existing%20datatype%20declaration.%0A%20%2A%20Missing%2Fextra%20constructors%20must%20not%20be%20hidden%20by%20an%20optional-value%20encoding.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20owner%20%40returns%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readRustStandardSumSourceConstructors%28owner%29%7B%0A%20return%20owner%3D%3D%3D%27std%3A%3Aoption%3A%3AOption%27%3F%5B%27None%27%2C%27Some%27%5D%3Aowner%3D%3D%3D%27std%3A%3Aresult%3A%3AResult%27%3F%5B%27Ok%27%2C%27Err%27%5D%3A%5B%5D%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Zero-based%20actual%20type%20argument%20for%20the%20sole%20field%3B%20-1%20is%20a%20nullary%0A%20%2A%20constructor%20and%20-2%20refuses.%20The%20adapter%20retains%20actual%20constructor%20ownership%0A%20%2A%20separately%2C%20before%20passing%20its%20selected%20local%20variant%20name%20here.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20owner%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20constructor%20%40returns%20%7Bnumber%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readRustStandardSumSourceFieldArgument%28owner%2Cconstructor%29%7B%0A%20if%28owner%3D%3D%3D%27std%3A%3Aoption%3A%3AOption%27%29return%20constructor%3D%3D%3D%27None%27%3F-1%3Aconstructor%3D%3D%3D%27Some%27%3F0%3A-2%3B%0A%20if%28owner%3D%3D%3D%27std%3A%3Aresult%3A%3AResult%27%29return%20constructor%3D%3D%3D%27Ok%27%3F0%3Aconstructor%3D%3D%3D%27Err%27%3F1%3A-2%3B%0A%20return%20-2%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20owner%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20constructor%20%40returns%20%7Bnumber%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readRustStandardSumSourceConstructorArity%28owner%2Cconstructor%29%7B%0A%20const%20argument%3DreadRustStandardSumSourceFieldArgument%28owner%2Cconstructor%29%3B%0A%20return%20argument%3D%3D%3D-2%3F-1%3Aargument%3D%3D%3D-1%3F0%3A1%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Only%20this%20constructor%27s%20one%20actual%20payload%20determines%20every%20type%20argument.%0A%20%2A%20Other%20variants%20require%20an%20explicit%20or%20contextual%20complete%20sum%20type.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%2